  "notes": "<p>This show was Phish's 96th performance at Madison Square Garden. Trey wore the velour button-down from the Clifford Ball. Before the show, the light rig approximated the NY Knicks' logo. The Star Spangled Banner was <span>last performed </span><a href=\"https://phish.net/setlists/phish-december-28-2016-madison-square-garden-new-york-ny-usa.html\"><span>December 28, 2016</span></a><span> (362 shows). Talk was last performed </span><a href=\"https://phish.net/setlists/phish-october-13-2023-united-center-chicago-il-usa.html\"><span>October 13, 2023</span></a><span> (122 shows). In Axilla (Part II) Trey began the lyrics to part I, said \"Wait we did that one already\", and recommenced part II.</span></p>",
